    REFACTOR-0003: the reports loop over MusicSource, not over each platform
    
    Each report called every platform's SDK and read its fields itself, so
    adding a platform meant a new block in every report. MyWrapped now
    wraps each client in its adapter once, in the constructor, and each
    report loops over allPlays() once. The reports never call an SDK, never
    see a platform-specific field name, and don't know which platform a
    play came from.
    
    The constructor still takes one client per platform and names every
    adapter, so adding a platform still changes MyWrapped.

